title: "LLMs in Robotics: A Snapshot"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Crespo
    given-names: Randy
    affiliation: Dandelion Engineering
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dandelion-Engineering/LLMs-in-Robotics-A-Snapshot"
abstract: >-
  A human-directed exploration of an AI agent controlling a simulated robot,
  with persistent files supporting continuity between sessions. The snapshot
  includes project decisions, software, experiment records, and a short
  presentation. Randy Crespo is the responsible human maintainer. AI systems
  materially assisted with code, documentation, analysis, and presentation.
  The project is exploratory and does not establish real-robot performance or
  a causal benefit from memory. See LICENSING.md for the distinct licenses
  applying to original code, prose and media, and third-party materials.
keywords:
  - robotics simulation
  - AI agents
  - human-AI collaboration
  - persistent memory
  - agent continuity
  - MuJoCo
